s://a.gup.pe/u/anarchism&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@anarchism&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://rassilni.com/system/media_attachments/files/114/775/138/178/742/254/original/f99a367dc86ca091.png&quot; alt=&quot;image From Sarah Lazare

@JVPChicago hunger strikers are entering their third week without calories. They report fatigue and pain, difficulty regulating their temperatures and difficulty walking. It&#39;s so upsetting that they have been put in this position. I hope their demands are met soon.

&lt;attachment text&gt;

